      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GLOWING (5) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (28.91) at this track in a R/A FIN. Lines up from box 5 for the first time. Sure to be about the mark. DASH INTENTION (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (26.31) in a Grade 5 at Warragul. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Shapes as one to consider. DR. ODIN (8) ran well two back scoring a Grade 5 win in 24.62 then out of the placings at Traralgon latest but returns to a course where he has performed well. Well placed here and can atone this time. TWISTED FANTASY (2) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
